Tim,

It may be a data issue, or some as-yet not observed challenge in the algorithm (though the latter has been rather thoroughly explored). You did mention 6 fixed landmarks with our 100, or 500, or thousands of sliders, and if those sliders are not really homologously aligned relative to the fixed points, or if the fixed points re not really fixed points, some strange things could happen. From the image you sent that is hard for me to determine. Regardless, without additional details it is just impossible to know.

If you email me off-line with more details of the data etc. I can try to take some time to investigate this with you.

Dean

